# sys-villa-boundary. The Villa is out of scope. A constructed start in the Resort Area
# beside the school kid's coord event: he offers the Villa, YES, he walks the player in (the TV segment op is a logged
# stub), the door animation plays and the warp lands in the Villa, whose onTransition's furniture features
# (init_persisted_map_features_for_villa) are a logged stub; the first-entry scene offers the free table (the only
# entry), and the delivery scene runs (until then the school kid stops the player at the door). Then out by the door to
# the Resort Area: no hang, no crash.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 60 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
set flag platinum:FLAG_GAME_COMPLETED true
date 2009-03-22 12:00
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_RESORT_AREA 814 473 right
until idle
+0 press right
+1 release right
advance text 3000
+8 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_VILLA
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_RESORT_AREA_STATE 1
# The first entry: the free table from the list (the only entry), its delivery.
+8 press a
+1 release a
advance text 6000
until idle 1200
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_VILLA
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_VILLA_STATE 2
+0 press left
until position 9 6 300
+0 release left
+0 press down
until position 9 10 300
+0 release down
+0 press right
until position 11 10 300
+0 release right
+0 press down
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_RESORT_AREA" 300
+0 release down
advance text 3000
until idle 600
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_RESORT_AREA
